    "key": "D",
    "content": "Divide by 1000",
    "rationale": "Cambridge uses 1024, and the ÷ 8 step is still needed."
   }
  ],
  "explanation": "Always convert bits to bytes first (÷ 8), then each step up is ÷ 1024.",
